 "notes": [
  "GoogleButton is a Button preset with data-descope-provider google and custom.subType social. The content templates point its rule at an oauth-start task with an empty defaultProvider argument, so the provider comes from the pressed button (oauth-start reads `provider` first, then defaultProvider). The Google provider must be enabled in the project.",
  "Other providers: AppleButton, MicrosoftButton, GithubButton, FacebookButton, ... (components.md).",
  "Ids are console-shaped: screenId \"SC\" + 27 base62 chars, node ids 10-char nanoids equal to props.id. Using this screen twice in one flow: give the copy a new screenId (node ids only need to be unique within a screen)."
 ]
